{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40333","headline":"早春池亭独游三首 一 · 刘象","name":"早春池亭独游三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春意送残腊，春晴融小洲。\n蒲茸才簇岸，柳颊已遮楼。\n便有杯觞兴，可摅羁旅愁。\n凫鷖亦相狎，尽日戏清流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}